n in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rude"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being impolite to people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was very rude to walk into the movie theater late."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you travel."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "medieval "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having to do with the time between 500 and 1500 A.D."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Toledo has medieval architecture."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to suggest "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to talk about something someone may want to try"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: For art lovers, I suggest the Guggenheim Museum in Bilbao. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dangerous "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that can lead to injury or death"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Running of the Bulls in Pamplona can be dangerous."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flustered "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being confused or agitated"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was flustered after my flight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bumpy "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "bouncy, uncomfortable "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That was a bumpy flight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making Suggestions With Modals: Could, Shall, Let's"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the modals <span class=\"strong\">could</span>, <span class=\"strong\">shall</span>, and <span class=\"strong\">let's</span> to make suggestions.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Could you tell me what to see in Spain? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Let's look at these pamphlets. <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Darcy</span>:  Shall we go inside?"}, {"type": "text", "content": " You use <span class=\"strong\">let's</span> to make a suggestion to include the speaker and others.  <br/><br/>You use <span class=\"strong\">could</span> to make a suggestion sound more polite. You can also respond to a suggestion with <span class=\"strong\">could</span>.<br/> <br/>  You use <span class=\"strong\">shall</span> in formal situations. You use it to make a suggestion requesting permission or agreement."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le05ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and research sites and attractions in Spain."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down 5 interesting sites you want visit in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a sentence about each site."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your list with a partner. Does your partner agree with your list?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify attractions in Spain."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express intention about sites and attractions I want to visit."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my intentions with my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I respond to my partner's opinion. "}]}], "type": "sena"}